=== SUMMARY ===
The correctness bound Delta = 1/(2p) is a hard constraint in ALL
lattice-based HE schemes (TFHE, BFV, CKKS). The actual noise is
orders of magnitude below this bound, so round-then-sort recovery
is exact regardless of the specific HE scheme.
